<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第五幕 · 怎么判断</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>第二句：先看清你手上那圈东西的边界</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 420, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 88, fontWeight: 700, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.0}}>五问</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 14}}>改不动的地方，就是天花板。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 708, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", gap: 12}}><Text style={{fontSize: 28, color: "#1C1F23"}}>模型能不能换</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 28, color: "#1C1F23"}}>工具能不能加</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 28, color: "#1C1F23"}}>执行后端能不能换</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 28, color: "#1C1F23"}}>门禁能不能自己定</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 28, color: "#1C1F23"}}>事实能不能重建</Text></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", marginTop: 8}}>用第三幕那五个问题，给自己手上的那套过一遍。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>40 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
